<report>
<title>Sample size for <in>tt</in> Student t test</title>

<p>Alpha = <in>alpha</in><br />
Power = <in>power</in><br />
Difference <in>mean</in> = <in>delta</in><br />
Standard deviation = <in>sd</in></p>
<block name="controls"><p>Controls per experimental subject <in>con_per</in></p></block>

<p>Estimated minimum sample size = <in>size</in> <block name="pairs">pairs</block><block name="subjects"> experimental subjects and <in>con_tot</in> controls.</block></p>

<p>Degrees of freedom = <in>df</in></p>
<block name="assumptions">

<p>NB:Assumptions of this calculation may cause over estimation of sample size when power is low.<br />
However, true power associated with <in>cases</in> cases will be no less than <in>no_less</in> and no greater than <in>no_greater</in>.</p>
</block>
</report>
